==Smelting==
Before a [[Blacksmith]] can use the harvested metal, it must be turned into an ingot at a Smelting Furnace. A furnace can often be found just outside of the mines.

===Recipes===
==== Copper Bar ====
:'''''Ingredients:''''' Copper Ore x5, Singing Coal x3

